  "releaseNotes": "* Added ``ExceptionThrower`` static helper class for throwing exceptions\n* Added Storage Drive retrieval through ``IStorageDriveDetector`` and ``StorageDriveDetector`` along with static singleton instance through ``StorageDrives.Shared``\n* Added Safe Directory and File Enumeration through ``ISafeDirectoryProvider`` and ``SafeDirectoryProvider`` class along with static singleton instance ``SafeDirectoryEnumeration.Shared``\n* Added overloads to ``WindowsFilePermissionManager`` using FileInfo and DirectoryInfo\n* Deprecated some ``WindowsFilePermissionManager`` methods for removal in v5\n* Deprecated ``PathEnvironmentVariable`` static class for removal in v5",
